    <color name="md_theme_dark_chart_series_2">#F4B2E4</color>
    <color name="md_theme_dark_chart_series_3">#A5D6A7</color>

    <!--
      Avatar palette. Six hues that deliberately steer clear of the brand indigo: the point of
      the colour is to tell one player from another, so it has to come from the player rather
      than from the theme. Each is used at full strength for the initial and at low alpha for
      the circle behind it, so both tones come from one entry.
    -->
